WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 8.1 · Marketing & Communications
Communications strategy

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Start from your objectives: who must do what, and how will you know?

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Link every communication objective to a strategic objective.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Name one audience and one action you can count.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Be honest about time, skills, budget and approvals.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Pan del Barrio (Social enterprise · company, Peru)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Two new employer partners by December, and a job interview for every graduate who completes the apprenticeship.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You write two to four communication objectives.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
